      "compound_name": "[DyIII3MnIII6(L)6(μ2-OMe)6(OAc)(H2O)2(HOMe)3](NO3)2·6H2O",
      "formula": "[Dy3Mn6(L)6(μ2-OMe)6(OAc)(H2O)2(HOMe)3](NO3)2·6H2O",
